\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\fs28\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 AI-Powered Safe Route Navigation for Nigeria}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\fs28\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 Awarri Developer Challenge 2025}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 System Overview}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
RouteGuardian is a comprehensive travel safety application designed specifically for Nigeria's unique transportation challenges. The application addresses a critical need in a country where travelers face varied security conditions across different region
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 s\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
, from urban congestion in Lagos to security advisories in northern states. By combining modern mobile technology with artificial intelligence, RouteGuardian empowers users to make informed decisions about their travel routes.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 The system follows a three-t\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
ier architecture that separates concerns between the user interface, AI processing layer, and external data sources. This design ensures scalability, maintainability, and the ability to operate both online and offline. The Flutter-based frontend provides 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 c\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 ross-platform compatibility, while the Python-based N-ATLaS server handles all AI inference and data aggregation tasks.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\insrsid15748431 
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par 
