\par \tab \bullet \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  Privacy-First - On-device processing, no cloud
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 External Services:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\par \tab \bullet \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  Google Maps API (Directions, Geocoding, Maps SDK)
\par \tab \bullet \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  NewsAPI.org (Real-time Nigeria news feed)
\par \tab \bullet \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  SQLite (Local incident database)
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 How N-ATLaS is Leveraged}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 RouteGuardian integrates }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 N-ATLaS (Llama 3.2 3B)}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 , \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 The model serves as the core intelligence engine, providing c\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
ontext-aware safety analysis that understands Nigerian locations, security terminology, and local nuances that generic AI models would miss.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 AI-Powered Safety Scoring:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  When a user requests route alternatives, the system collects news articles and incident\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
 reports for locations along each route. N-ATLaS processes these texts to identify safety-relevant information, classifying incidents by type (robbery, kidnapping, accident, traffic congestion) and assessing their severity on a 0-100 scale. The model uses
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
natural language understanding to parse headlines like "Security forces deploy on Kaduna-Zaria highway" and determine whether this indicates increased safety (more patrols) or heightened risk (active threat response).
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 Intelligent Text Classification:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  The \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
N-ATLaS model performs multi-label classification on news content, identifying incident categories and extracting location mentions. This enables the system to map incidents to specific route segments rather than entire cities, providing granular safety a
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 s\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 sessments. For example, the model can distinguish between an incident on the Lagos-Ibadan expressway versus one within Lagos city, affecting different routes differently.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 Local Inference Architecture:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  Unlike cloud-based AI solutions, RouteGuardian runs N-\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
ATLaS locally using the llama-cpp-python library. The quantized GGUF model (3GB) is optimized for efficient inference on consumer hardware, enabling real-time analysis without internet dependency. This architecture choice ensures user privacy\hich\f0 
\emdash \loch\f0 travel patte\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 r\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 ns and location data never leave the device\hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 and provides resilience in areas with poor connectivity, common in many Nigerian regions.}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid11356447\charrsid15748431 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 Data Flow & Processing Pipeline}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 The application implements a sophisticated data pipeline that combines multiple inform\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 ation sources to generate comprehensive safety assessments:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 1. Route Request:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
 The Flutter app sends origin and destination coordinates to the N-ATLaS server, which proxies the request to Google Directions API. The server retrieves up to three alternative \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
routes with full polyline data containing 200+ waypoints for accurate road-following visualization.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 2. Location Extraction:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  For each route, the system identifies key locations along the path\hich\f0 \emdash \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
cities, highways, and regions that the route traverses. These locations become the search targets for news and incident data.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 3. News Aggregation (Triple Fallback):}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  The server implements a robust triple-fallback strategy for news retrieval. First, it atte\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
mpts NewsAPI.org for high-quality, structured articles. If unavailable, it falls back to Google News web scraping. Finally, if both fail, a curated demo database provides baseline safety information for major Nigerian routes. This ensures the system alway
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 s\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  provides some level of intelligence, even offline.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 4. AI Analysis:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
 Collected news items are fed to the N-ATLaS model for safety analysis. The model evaluates each headline for threat indicators, assigns severity scores, and generates human-readable warni\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
ngs. Results are aggregated per-route to produce a final safety score (0-100) and prioritized list of concerns.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 5. User Presentation:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\dn20\insrsid2172778\charrsid10895192 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
 The Flutter app displays route alternatives on an interactive map, with each route color-coded by safety level (green = s\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
afe, yellow = moderate, red = avoid). Users can tap routes to see detailed AI-generated warnings and make informed travel decisions.
